# A model shown for the first time comes whole in its first frame, never a
# flat silhouette (render::prepass_gate): the player's own body and Halo gun
# after `thirdperson`, then a Combat Arms practice target and its gun, a
# picture every 2 frames (a scene script: chimera_client's `scene`). In
# each sequence a part is absent, then drawn textured; no frame shows a
# hole of the old frame or the sky where it stands.
#   cargo run --features dev --bin ultimate_gun_game -- --offscreen 1600x900 +volume 0 +sandbox cs_source:de_dust2 \
#       --scene apps/ultimate_gun_game/scenes/first_frame_whole.scene --out <dir>
wait_for map_loaded 6000
wait_for spawned 3000
wait 300
setpos -82 -555 208
setang 2 4
rung halo_ce:plasma_pistol
wait 300
thirdperson
cam_idealdist 80
cam_idealyaw 150
shot self_0
wait 2
